Summarise a cargo-llvm-cov JSON summary for the GitHub job page

Usage: cargo xtask coverage-summary <LABEL> <COVERAGE>

Arguments:
  <LABEL>
          The label for the summary

  <COVERAGE>
          The JSON summary

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
